WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.875 --> 00:00:17.046
1. Open the tail, 9MKB.

2
00:00:17.046 --> 00:00:42.375
2. Open the head, 7VS5, as five instances.

3
00:00:42.375 --> 00:01:03.605
3. Put the tail on the head (matchmaker).

4
00:01:03.605 --> 00:01:21.110
4. Name the parts (a script, after an OK).

5
00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:44.578
5. Remove the capsomers the head already has.

6
00:01:44.578 --> 00:02:22.173
6. Color by part.

7
00:02:22.173 --> 00:02:46.205
7. Spheres, full lighting, outlines.

8
00:02:46.205 --> 00:03:01.837
8. The baseplate from below.

9
00:03:01.837 --> 00:03:23.014
9. The neck, where the tail joins the head.

10
00:03:23.014 --> 00:03:42.976
10. The cell-puncturing spike.

11
00:03:42.976 --> 00:04:08.129
11. Save an image.

12
00:04:08.129 --> 00:04:27.659
12. Back to the whole virion.

13
00:04:27.659 --> 00:04:44.962
13. Add the trigger and contraction (a script).

14
00:04:44.962 --> 00:05:18.084
14. Play: trigger, then contraction.

